{"id":"n63201-1-7","stage":4,"title":"선후배 · 师兄弟","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63201-1-7-1","ko":"두 사람이 꽤 친해 보이네요.","zh":"这两个人看起来挺要好的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친해","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed1d320580737b5e0e99.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63201-1-7-2","ko":"네, 저희는 오랫동안 알고 지낸 대학 선후배 사이에요.","zh":"是的，我们是认识很久的大学学长学妹关系。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희는","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오랫동안","meaning":"长时间，长期以来","explanation":"오랫동안：长时间，长期以来","readings":[{"term":"오랫동안","audio":"/audio/e8e242dddefc476de58c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83165","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랫동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알고","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지낸","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대학","meaning":"大学","explanation":"대학：大学","readings":[{"term":"대학","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61281","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선후배","meaning":"师兄弟，前后辈","explanation":"선후배：师兄弟，前后辈","readings":[{"term":"선후배","audio":"/audio/021740018842040bfbb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63201","senseId":"1","lemma":"선후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이에요.","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"e8e242dddefc476d","term":"오랫동안","zh":"长时间，长期以来","audio":"/audio/e8e242dddefc476de58c.mp3","entryId":"83165","definition":"非常长的时间。","pronunciation":["오래똥안","오랟똥안"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"相处，交往","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"与他人维持一定的关系过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"a5aac0eac3be8a95","term":"대학","zh":"大学","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3","entryId":"61281","definition":"高中毕业后进入的高等教育机构。","pronunciation":["대ː학"]},{"id":"021740018842040b","term":"선후배","zh":"师兄弟，前后辈","audio":"/audio/021740018842040bfbb4.mp3","entryId":"63201","definition":"师兄和师弟，或前辈和后辈。","pronunciation":["선후배"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]}],"audio":"/audio/a4fb0c82c0a6c24286ce.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63201","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6623,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，我们是认识很久的大学学长学妹关系。","听说承奎这次的业务又取得了巨大成功啊？","这两个人看起来挺要好的呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，我们是认识很久的大学学长学妹关系。","这两个人看起来挺要好的呢。","听说承奎这次的业务又取得了巨大成功啊？"],"answer":0}]}
